---
/**
 * ThemeProvider override (B10: dark only). Starlight's default reads
 * localStorage and prefers-color-scheme to pick light or dark; starhold.fyi has
 * one theme, so this pins it and never touches storage. Other Starlight code
 * calls `StarlightThemeProvider.updatePickers()`, so a no-op stays defined.
 * Inline so the attribute is set before first paint.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} };
</script>